    {%- else -%}
      <h3>[TO FILL - Return Policy & Discovery Guarantee]</h3>
      <p>[TO FILL - Terms of the discovery vial trial and evaluation period]</p>
      <p>[TO FILL - Eligibility conditions and return timeframe for full refund]</p>
      <p>[TO FILL - Instructions on how to contact concierge to initiate return]</p>
